ACCEPTANCE.md
# Recorded fixtures embed real paths, symbol names and signatures from whatever repo
# they were captured against. Regenerate locally; never commit.
test/fixtures/*
# Exception: the Cards view model's fixtures (test/cards-view-model.test.js) are live analyses of
# public repositories (cli/cli, t3code, honojs/hono, encode/httpx) trimmed to the fields the
# model reads, so the test runs without a target repository. They hold paths and symbol names
# of those repositories only.
!test/fixtures/cards/

# Internal working docs: build plan and acceptance checklist, written against a private
# codebase and full of its measurements. Kept locally, not published.
PLAN.md
ACCEPTANCE.md
.env
# The PostHog key, written when packaging (scripts/write-telemetry-key.js); it ships in the
# .vsix but stays out of the repository.
src/telemetry/telemetry-key.js

docs/distribution-checklist.md
docs/CODE_DESIGN_PROPOSAL.md
# Last run time of each test file, written by test/run.js to order the next run.
test/.timings.json
